from __future__ import annotations

NAME = "Io, the Volcano Moon"
AMBIENCE = "Distant Thunder"

# A soothing sleep-lecture about the most volcanic world in the solar system, warmed from within by tidal heating.
SECTIONS = [['You are lying down now, and there is nothing left for you to do.', 'Let your body grow heavy against whatever is holding you.', 'Feel the weight of your shoulders sinking down, soft and slow.', 'There is no hurry here, and there is nowhere else you need to be.', 'Let your breath come in gently, and let it go even more gently.', 'With each slow breath out, you let a little more of the day fall away.', 'Your hands can rest now, your jaw can soften, your forehead can smooth.', 'Let your eyes close, and let the darkness feel kind and roomy.', 'Imagine, very softly, that you are looking up at a night sky.', 'High above you, one steady point of light glows warm and patient.', 'That light is a great and distant planet, far across the quiet dark.', 'Let yourself drift, slowly and easily, out toward one of its small moons.'], ['You are drifting now toward a little world called Io.', 'Io is one of the moons that circles the giant planet Jupiter.', "It is the closest of Jupiter's four large moons, the nearest to the glow.", 'Long ago, in the year sixteen ten, a man named Galileo first saw it.', 'He looked through a small telescope and saw four tiny lights beside Jupiter.', 'Those four lights were moons, and Io was the innermost of them all.', 'For hundreds of years it was only a faint and gentle spark.', 'Now you are drifting close enough to see it turn before you.', 'Io is a small round world, painted in soft warm colours.', 'It glows in yellows and oranges, in pale whites and gentle reds.', 'It is the most quietly remarkable little moon in all the solar system.', 'Let yourself float nearer, calm and unhurried, and simply look.'], ['Io is a world that is always warm inside, always softly stirring.', "It is the most volcanic world anywhere among the sun's many moons.", 'Hundreds of volcanoes rest upon its surface, glowing slow and low.', 'You might wonder how such a small far moon stays so warm within.', 'The answer is a gentle, endless kneading deep inside its rock.', 'Mighty Jupiter pulls on Io with a vast and patient gravity.', 'And two sister moons, Europa and Ganymede, tug softly too.', 'Caught between these pulls, Io is flexed a little, over and over.', 'This slow flexing is called tidal heating, a quiet bending of stone.', 'The bending warms the deep rock the way kneaded dough grows warm.', 'So Io is heated from within by the steady rhythm of these tides.', 'Imagine that slow inner warmth, and let your own body feel warm and soft.'], ["Across Io's surface lie lakes of glowing molten rock.", 'They rest in wide dark hollows, shining with a dim and dreamlike light.', 'One of the largest is a great lava lake called Loki Patera.', 'It is broad and round, a still pool of distant amber glow.', 'From some of the volcanoes, tall plumes of gas drift slowly upward.', 'These are fountains of sulphur, rising soft and silent into space.', 'Some of them climb hundreds of kilometres above the little moon.', 'With no wind to bend them, they spread in wide and graceful arcs.', 'Then the sulphur drifts back down and settles as a pale, soft frost.', 'It falls so gently, like snow that is warm instead of cold.', 'All of this happens slowly, far away, in a deep and peaceful quiet.', 'Let those slow rising plumes carry your thoughts upward and away.'], ['The whole face of Io is painted in tender, glowing colours.', 'Sulphur and its many forms wash the surface in yellow and gold.', 'There are patches of orange, streaks of white, and soft red rings.', 'It looks a little like a canvas left out under a warm low sun.', 'Most worlds are pocked all over with the round scars of old craters.', 'But Io has almost none, and this is a curious and lovely thing.', 'Its volcanoes are forever laying down fresh new layers of rock.', 'Again and again they repave the surface, smoothing it anew.', 'So Io is always young, always freshly painted, never still for long.', 'It is one of the few worlds whose face is gently made over and over.', 'Picture that warm, ever-changing canvas turning slowly in the dark.', 'And let your own thoughts grow smooth and soft and freshly calm.'], ['Io races around Jupiter once in only about one and a half days.', 'It always keeps the very same face turned toward the giant planet.', 'So one side of Io watches Jupiter forever, like a quiet companion.', 'For a long while, no one knew how alive this little moon truly was.', 'Then in nineteen seventy-nine a spacecraft called Voyager flew past.', 'An engineer named Linda Morabito was studying one of its images.', 'At the edge of Io she noticed a faint and curious soft shape.', 'It was a great plume, an eruption caught rising into space.', 'It was the first time anyone had seen a volcano on another world.', 'What had seemed a still small dot was glowing and alive.', 'And it had been glowing patiently all along, far out in the dark.', 'Let that quiet wonder settle over you, soft and warm and slow.'], ['Now let Io drift slowly back into the gentle distance.', 'Let its warm orange glow grow dim and faint and far away.', 'You are floating again in the soft and roomy dark.', 'There is nothing to reach for and nothing left to do.', 'Your breath is slow now, slower with every quiet wave.', 'Let the last warm light fade softly into the deep calm night.', 'Your body is heavy and held, sinking gently into rest.', 'Each breath out carries you a little further toward sleep.', 'The distant moon glows on without you, patient and serene.', 'And you are letting go, drifting down into warm soft darkness.', 'Your eyes are heavy, your thoughts are slow, and all is well.', 'Let yourself sink the rest of the way, and drift off to sleep.']]
